Sun Nov  8 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of the Bluecurve cursor theme 8.0.2, replacing
  the build from Phantom X's chinforpms Copr
  * Cursors only, taken from Fedora's last bluecurve-icon-theme
    tarball plus the Bluecurve-classic sets from chinforpms
  * Keep the chinforpms cursor aliases (freedesktop, Qt, GTK and
    Mozilla names) and upstream's symlink.manifest links
  * Epoch 1, as in the Copr package, so this one is an upgrade
  * Run %fdupes -s: the inverse and classic sets share many cursors
